      "kind": "form",
      "code": "Option Explicit\n\nDim gScore as BigNumber\nDim gBPS as BigNumber\n\nPrivate Sub UpdateScoreAndBPSLabel()\n    lblScore.Caption = gScore.Display()\n    lblBPS.Caption = gBPS.Display()\n    \nEnd Sub\n\n\nPrivate Sub Form_Load()\n    Set gScore = new BigNumber\n    Set gBPS = new BigNumber\n    \n    gScore = \"0\"\n    gBPS = \"1\"\n        \n    UpdateScoreAndBPSLabel()\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub CommandButton1_Click()\n    gScore.Add(gBPS)\n    UpdateScoreAndBPSLabel()\nEnd Sub\n",
